    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror game where the supernatural isn\u2019t just terrifying\u2014it\u2019s also completely ridiculous. Face mischievous, unpredictable ghosts, perform chaotic rituals, and survive the ever-growing madness. Can you outsmart the hauntings, or will the trick be on you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER Online CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to three friends in this chaotic horror experience. Work together to locate cursed objects, set up the ritual, and deal with the bizarre, unpredictable entities standing in your way. Each game feels fresh, thanks to randomized enemy behaviors, supernatural debuffs, and maps that keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/18869ca155ec30c64d5e75fa09400600.poster.avif?t=1747967766\" width=800 height=135 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/18869ca155ec30c64d5e75fa09400600.webm?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNPREDICTABLE AND GOOFY SPIRITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spirits in <i>Hauntrick</i> are anything but ordinary. Each one behaves differently\u2014some are goofy, some are unpredictable, and others have their own strange ways of interfering with the ritual. You never know what they'll do next, making every encounter unexpected and full of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN IS DIFFERENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session in <i>Hauntrick</i> throws new surprises your way. Procedurally generated maps, randomized cursed objects, and a rotating cast of unique spirits make sure no two runs feel the same. Adapt fast, or get tricked into an early grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/c839f4bfa96c0878f2b75dabc2fba506.poster.avif?t=1747967766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/c839f4bfa96c0878f2b75dabc2fba506.webm?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/c839f4bfa96c0878f2b75dabc2fba506.mp4?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERFORM THE RITUAL, BANISH THE CURSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: find the cursed objects scattered around the map and place them in the ritual circle. However, with spirits lurking around every corner, working quickly and efficiently is key\u2014hesitation will only make things harder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY, SURVIVE, REPEAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hauntrick</i>, collecting coins isn\u2019t just for show\u2014it\u2019s your key to survival. Use your earnings to buy powerful items from the shop, giving you a fighting chance against the unpredictable hauntings. Use the spell, English or Spanish, to freeze spirits in place, turn invisible with a special pill, teleport out of danger, or even arm yourself with a gun. Whether you choose to escape, outsmart, or fight back, the shop ensures that every run offers new strategies to survive the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/821f43978b365fdbadb7cc437510c93c.poster.avif?t=1747967766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/821f43978b365fdbadb7cc437510c93c.webm?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/821f43978b365fdbadb7cc437510c93c.mp4?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC DEBUFFS: EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to make things even crazier? Enable the <strong>Debuff Setting</strong> and suffer through randomized effects that change how you play. Lose the ability to jump. Get your controls reversed. Drop items uncontrollably. Or get hit with a surprise game of <i>Red Light, Green Light.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE CHAOS, OR BECOME ITS NEXT VICTIM?</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror game where the supernatural isn\u2019t just terrifying\u2014it\u2019s also completely ridiculous. Face mischievous, unpredictable ghosts, perform chaotic rituals, and survive the ever-growing madness. Can you outsmart the hauntings, or will the trick be on you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER Online CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to three friends in this chaotic horror experience. Work together to locate cursed objects, set up the ritual, and deal with the bizarre, unpredictable entities standing in your way. Each game feels fresh, thanks to randomized enemy behaviors, supernatural debuffs, and maps that keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/18869ca155ec30c64d5e75fa09400600.poster.avif?t=1747967766\" width=800 height=135 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/18869ca155ec30c64d5e75fa09400600.webm?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNPREDICTABLE AND GOOFY SPIRITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spirits in <i>Hauntrick</i> are anything but ordinary. Each one behaves differently\u2014some are goofy, some are unpredictable, and others have their own strange ways of interfering with the ritual. You never know what they'll do next, making every encounter unexpected and full of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN IS DIFFERENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session in <i>Hauntrick</i> throws new surprises your way. Procedurally generated maps, randomized cursed objects, and a rotating cast of unique spirits make sure no two runs feel the same. Adapt fast, or get tricked into