tem_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/821f43978b365fdbadb7cc437510c93c.webm?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561580/extras/821f43978b365fdbadb7cc437510c93c.mp4?t=1747967766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC DEBUFFS: EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to make things even crazier? Enable the <strong>Debuff Setting</strong> and suffer through randomized effects that change how you play. Lose the ability to jump. Get your controls reversed. Drop items uncontrollably. Or get hit with a surprise game of <i>Red Light, Green Light.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE CHAOS, OR BECOME ITS NEXT VICTIM?</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Hauntrick is a chaotic, goofy horror game where you hunt cursed objects, perform rituals, and survive bizarre hauntings\u2014solo or with friends. The ghosts? Unpredictable, absurd, and hilariously annoying. Every match is a mix of strategy, panic, and laughter as reality itself starts to unravel.",
